n...\n- wie das Publikum sich zusammensetzt\n- wie lange der Vortrag maximal sein darf (mit Stoppuhr)\n- wie Aufmerksam das Publikum zuh\u00f6rt\n\nIm Nachgang kannst Du dir nochmal anschauen und anh\u00f6ren, wie gut Du dich geschlagen hast.\n\nDie aktuellen R\u00e4ume sind:\n- Konferenzraum mit 3 Personen (Bewerbungsgespr\u00e4ch)\n- Seminarraum"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ImpLandscape.png", "id": "2476178992540280", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65398055_2476178995873613_5890563130306836643_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CC6rmBgQafMQ7kNvwEZ3ayJ&_nc_oc=AdrzAvPey_Qu_FdTBHMeSvg-M9twVsGESEMDGb6hmA2z-v8LratdLXU5VGuX6FF7acc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Wg-bsvu-cPdEcjVgozOHmJHNh9oli6QdWMpZ9K-_-7w&oe=6A119D47"}, {"file_name": "ImpCover.png", "id": "2401543720011882", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575350_2401543723345215_1378399666035813534_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UAUs14P9qVAQ7kNvwHfScVo&_nc_oc=Adp-4YpzmlypR4wUtY0cLXetUY-8BTK7g0zgEKHr6sCkYJUMrWsCqWUdB1ccKWiXSaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6HEg9CzBkH-T9TlW65dyBwJlMvDkeUw1J7uaMLvsPA4A&oe=6A11AAFC"}, {"file_name": "ImpHero.png", "id": "1575384222929044", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974551_1575384226262377_3077729185527084450_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yByjT7UgGg8Q7kNvwEtfA-U&_nc_oc=AdpwhbDKThqb-Fc1nQjW-DWj52yXD1IxhU8wDqSHqPZm8j1QbCNZjkd3kJ947fpfb48&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6MFsS1ZAMUIQEJYhL5cDojAzTs4GEVBuRjxnjWlMmCPg&oe=6A119C2B"}, {"file_name": "Basic ohne Claim (3).png", "id": "1408933533196382", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974709_1408933536529715_446